 .../language/resource.language.en_gb/strings.po  |  8 ++++----
 .../language/resource.language.es_ar/strings.po  | 16 ++++++++--------
 .../language/resource.language.es_es/strings.po  | 16 ++++++++--------
 .../language/resource.language.es_mx/strings.po  | 16 ++++++++--------
 5 files changed, 32 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)

